---

The bindings in this repository contain no ClickHouse code. They load, at run
time, a separately distributed native artifact that embeds a build of
ClickHouse (https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickHouse, Apache License 2.0).
Those artifacts are NOT covered by this repository's licence: each artifact
release carries its own LICENSE file and is distributed under the Elastic
License 2.0. See docs/artifacts.md.

tests/fixtures/fetch/test-key/ contains an ed25519 key pair, both halves, that
signs the fetch test fixtures and nothing else. It is derived from a public
seed and is deliberately not secret; it is never the artifact release key.
